These are the template files for the AI use and non-use declarations.

Before you commit a branch to a pull request: 
1. Download the appropriate template
2. Sign it with the correct details filled in
3. Name it with the following convention:
    AI used: YYYY-MM-DD_BranchName_AI.docx
    No AI used: YYYY-MM-DD_BranchName_NAI.docx

4. Upload it in /declarations/
